// Compositor (compositor_ps20b / compositor_vs20): one texture compositor stage
// per $combine_mode (multiply, add, lerp, selector, blend) with level
// adjustment ($texadjustlevels: black, white, gamma; identity for some inputs,
// not for others) and $textransform0..3. $textransform1..3 live in c4..c5,
// over cModelViewProj, which the shader API committed before the compositor
// wrote them, so they reach the shader as D3D9 leaves them. The compositor
// sets $srctexture0..3 on the material, which never loads them (the cases do
// the same with "texturevars").
